% expect-output: {ucache 10.0 10.0 60.0 70.0 setbbox 10.0 10.0 moveto 20.0 20.0 lineto 30.0 40.0 50.0 60.0 60.0 20.0 curveto closepath 40.0 70.0 moveto}
% Scenario: upath reports the path in the current user space, taking
% the stored coordinates back through the CTM, with the box enclosing
% every point, a curve's control points and a trailing moveto
% included.
100 100 translate 2 2 scale
10 10 moveto 20 20 lineto 30 40 50 60 60 20 curveto closepath 40 70 moveto
true upath ==
